{"cite":"RFC 09 §2.2","key_expr":"zensight/v1/*/telemetry/**","reason":"declares replication on volume /"influxdb/", whose history mode is all — the storage manager refuses to start such a storage, so this plan refuses it first (anti-entropy aligns one value per key; an all-mode volume cannot participate)","row":"refusal","storage":"history"}
{"cite":"RFC 09 §2","key_expr":"zensight/v1/*/state/**","reason":"names volume /"rocks/", which [volumes] does not declare","row":"refusal","storage":"stray"}
