```

Without a registry the plan degrades and says so (#210): every lifespan is
RFC 09 §2.3's default, marked unverified, and no selector is judged against a
declared subject — not asked is not empty (RFC 13 §3 O4).

```console
$ zenctl storage gen --deployment tests/cmd/fixtures/storages.toml --zenoh-config tests/cmd/fixtures/dead-bus.json5 --format ndjson
